WEBVTT

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.470
Mattsun!

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.650
What are you doing?

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.400
The game's about to start.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:18.270
Okay.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:52.110
Wow!

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:55.320
Kei-chan's volleyball team keeps winning.

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:57.400
The girls' team is still winning, too.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:02:00.640
As expected with Chiba-chan as captain!

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:03.790
Hey! Working hard, tennis team?

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.880
How's it going? Winning?

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:07.000
Yeah.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.970
Our second match starts soon,
so we're headed outside.

00:02:09.970 --> 00:02:12.170
Oh. Which team are you against next?

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:13.690
3-6.

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:16.330
If we win, we'll face
Mocchi and the guys next.

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:18.340
Huh, Mocchi's doing tennis?

00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:21.100
Anyways, Tsuyopon, we've got to win!

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:23.330
Na-chan, I leave that in your hands.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.260
The guy is Na-chan's rival, after all!

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:28.080
We're facing Taizou's class next ourselves.

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.280
Let's give it our best!

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.470
Yeah!

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.060
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.990
Rina sprained her ankle
and can't play the next game.

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.640
Tsutsui-san, please fill in for her.

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:38.280
Huh?!

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:42.210
<i>I only picked basketball
because Anna was playing.</i>

00:02:42.210 --> 00:02:44.160
<i>I thought I'd be safe as a benchwarmer.</i>

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.520
<i>I mean, I can't play at all!</i>

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.580
<i>I can't dribble, and I don't
really know the rules!</i>

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.380
<i>Oh, this is awful!</i>

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.650
<i>I wish Anna would console me.</i>

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:55.440
<i>Where is she?!</i>

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:58.460
<i>Wait, is the game starting already?</i>

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:00.650
<i>Anna!</i>

00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:01.800
Hey guys!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.670
We won!

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:09.540
<i>What are those guys doing?
Are they stupid?</i>

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.780
<i>Wait, have they already won?</i>

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:14.950
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:16.020
<i>I'll go look for Anna.</i>

00:03:16.790 --> 00:03:18.700
C'mon, let me down.

00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:20.860
It's been long enough!

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:22.870
Spitting Woman!

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.150
What's up?

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.220
Got a game?

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:27.280
No.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:28.580
I'm looking for Anna.

00:03:29.020 --> 00:03:32.250
I saw Kobayakawa-san
by the entrance not long ago.

00:03:32.620 --> 00:03:33.410
Huh? Really?

00:03:34.250 --> 00:03:35.750
Oh, shoot.

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:36.670
Wait.

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:38.820
That hurts!

00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.040
What're you doing, jerk?

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.300
Let go!

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:42.620
Sorry about that.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.630
I wanted to talk for a bit.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.970
Whoa, your hair's fluffy.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:48.160
Is it permed?

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.480
Or curled?

00:03:49.480 --> 00:03:50.560
Both.

00:03:51.520 --> 00:03:52.560
Wow...

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:55.020
What are you in, Spitting Woman?

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:56.640
Badminton? Ping-pong?

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.330
I'm a benchwarmer in basketball.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.960
Oh, a benchwarmer?

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:01.690
Then you won't be in a game.

00:04:01.690 --> 00:04:02.490
I am, actually.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.020
Then I'll come cheer for—

00:04:05.020 --> 00:04:06.030
Forget it!

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:08.790
Why not? I'm going out of my way for you.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:10.150
You're such a pain!

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.950
I'm not playing because I want to!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:13.830
I can't even play that well!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:15.580
Oh?

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.070
Now I wanna watch even more.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.880
We'll all come watch together.

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:21.580
You are such a pain!

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.210
Let go already!

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:24.010
I don't wanna.

00:04:24.010 --> 00:04:25.670
Why not?!

00:04:25.670 --> 00:04:27.490
Why, you ask?

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.930
Guys like teasing girls they like.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:32.150
Huh?

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:34.640
Quit saying creepy stuff.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.400
Hey, where are you going?

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:42.150
To find Anna!

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:45.570
<i>I just told her I liked her, didn't I?</i>

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:49.210
<i>Doesn't she get it?</i>

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.160
Hey, hey!

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:52.220
Let's go watch Na-chan and Tsuyopon.

00:04:52.220 --> 00:04:54.330
Sure, I'll come.

00:04:57.090 --> 00:04:58.910
I'm gonna grab a drink.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:01.250
Okay! See you there.

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:03.470
Aha!

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.010
I found a Mattsun!

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:06.590
Hm?

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.880
Hey, Rina-chan! Long time no see!

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:11.480
I know, right? I feel that way too.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.450
What happened to your leg?

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.210
You hurt it?

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.940
I sprained it in my last game.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:20.100
Now I can't play in the next one.

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:21.280
Really?

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:21.970
Boo.

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.110
That sucks.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:25.770
<i>So that's why Spitting Woman has to play.</i>

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.950
Hey, Mattsun!

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.670
What?

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:33.760
I'm going to the tennis court.

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:34.740
Let's sit here.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:36.620
Huh?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.490
Why, does your leg hurt?

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:40.210
Yeah, it hurts.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:43.310
So I have nothing to do.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:44.750
Let's play, okay?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:46.080
<i>"Play"?</i>

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.540
<i>"Play"...</i>

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:48.420
<i>Oh...</i>

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.800
<i>Well, I have to admit.</i>

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.160
<i>I used to think Rina was pretty great.</i>

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.520
<i>But now...</i>

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:00.520
Put your hands on my hips.

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:01.400
Wha?

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:04.520
You like kissing, right?

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.020
Right?

00:06:06.020 --> 00:06:08.320
Uh, listen...

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:10.240
I don't do this anymo—

00:06:11.990 --> 00:06:12.750
Ack!

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:14.120
Um, this is...

00:06:14.710 --> 00:06:16.960
Oh, dear! We've been spotted!

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:19.530
Tsutsui-san, sorry to make you fill in.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.170
Take care of the game for me!

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:22.630
Huh?

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:30.470
<i>You've gotta be kidding me!</i>

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:36.960
<i>She was looking at me like I was trash.</i>

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:42.120
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:06:42.120 --> 00:06:43.810
Hey, Mattsun!

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:47.220
We beat Mocchi!

00:06:47.220 --> 00:06:49.870
Really, Na-chan was amazing.

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:52.410
I barely had to move.

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:53.670
How nice for you.

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:55.530
What's wrong?

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.780
We're heading to watch Kobayakawa-san's game.

00:06:58.780 --> 00:07:00.330
You wanna come with?

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.620
Uh...

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:02.720
I'll pass.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:04.290
Really?

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:06.170
I need to cool my head.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:12.050
<i>And then, consider what to do.</i>

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:16.130
<i>She's not the type where I can just
say anything to convince her.</i>

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.050
<i>I guess, at times like this...</i>

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:20.430
<i>I need to demonstrate my sincerity?</i>

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.490
<i>How to demonstrate sincerity...</i>

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.900
<i>What is sincerity, anyway?</i>

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:31.200
<i>It's no good!</i>

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:33.470
<i>I doubt any of those will work on her!</i>

00:07:33.470 --> 00:07:35.820
<i>She'll spit on me or claw me,
and then it's over.</i>

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:42.040
Gah! What a pain in the ass!

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:44.780
<i>That's such a pain,
so I'll just tell her everything!</i>

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:46.540
<i>I'll kidnap her as soon as the match ends!</i>

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.620
<i>Yeah! If I tell her, she'll understand!</i>

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:54.010
<i>And if she doesn't, then I'll consider what to do.</i>

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:58.270
<i>She's sweating hard and
doing her best out there.</i>

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.180
<i>But...</i>

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.430
<i>Look ahead of you, not at the ball!</i>

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:03.400
<i>Argh! See?</i>

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.780
<i>You need to get back there quicker.</i>

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:08.560
<i>So she really is bad at basketball...</i>

00:08:08.560 --> 00:08:11.530
<i>If I'd known sooner,
I'd have helped her practice.</i>

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.980
I came to cheer you on.

00:08:22.450 --> 00:08:24.280
<i>She didn't respond?!</i>

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.170
<i>Well, she is in the middle of a game...</i>

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:27.820
<i>No, that's not why.</i>

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:29.920
<i>This won't work.</i>

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:35.200
<i>She's always hostile and angry.
It's such a pain.</i>

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:35.840
<i>But still...</i>

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:40.150
<i>If she'd look my way and smile,
or come to my side, I'd like that.</i>

00:08:40.150 --> 00:08:43.180
<i>Why do I feel this way?</i>

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:47.100
<i>Is she just that incredibly cute?</i>

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:48.100
<i>I dunno!</i>

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:51.770
<i>I'm not usually like this, but I still
end up dreaming about her.</i>

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:53.530
<i>So that's it!</i>

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:55.490
<i>I can't make myself give up on her.</i>

00:08:55.990 --> 00:08:58.230
<i>Looks like there's no escape...</i>

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:02.290
<i>I must really be an "M".</i>

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.620
<i>The guys are up there!?</i>

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:10.080
<i>Maybe I'll go join them.</i>

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:11.790
Time!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.180
Someone call a teacher!

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:14.990
You okay?

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:16.840
Hang in there!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.070
Tsutsui-san!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.010
Mari-chan!

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:22.640
Huh? What? What happened?

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:25.300
That girl got knocked over by a third-year.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:27.440
She may have hit her head.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.310
Mari-chan, are you okay?

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:30.150
Mari-chan!

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:30.910
Tsutsui-san.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.320
Satomi-sensei, hurry!

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:38.880
Sensei, Mari-chan isn't responding.

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:40.150
It'll be okay.

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:41.930
Don't worry.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:42.950
Is a Health Committee member here?

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:43.970
That's me.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.120
Where is Takeda-sensei?

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:47.080
I sent someone to get him.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:50.120
We'll have to carry her ourselves. then.

00:09:50.740 --> 00:09:52.340
You, help me.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:52.810
Right.

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:55.130
Sensei, I'll carry her.

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:02.800
Quiet down!

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:04.390
We're continuing the game!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.710
Um, Matsunaga-kun...

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.330
I'll come with you.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.470
Nah. You've got a game to play in.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:11.520
She'll be fine.

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:14.610
Leave her to me.

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.370
Uh, Mattsun...

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:17.610
That's amazing.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:18.530
Dang...

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.950
She has a mild concussion.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:23.870
I think she'll wake up soon.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:27.260
But she should be sent home early.

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.750
Oh, I see.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.130
What is keeping Takeda-sensei?

00:10:31.740 --> 00:10:32.710
Matsunaga-kun.

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:36.130
Do you know how to contact
Tsutsui-san's family?

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:38.050
No, I don't.

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:40.190
Well, I'll go check in the staff room.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:41.650
Could you watch her for a little while?

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:42.390
Sure.

00:10:42.820 --> 00:10:44.220
I should probably say.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:47.310
Don't do anything improper.

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:49.980
Right...

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:55.770
Hey, you okay?

00:10:59.860 --> 00:11:01.860
Whoa there, tiger.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:05.780
Spitting Woman, once you wake up...

00:11:06.840 --> 00:11:11.210
No, it can wait until tomorrow,
but we really should talk...

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.210
Maa-kun.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:17.130
Spitting Woman?

00:11:18.180 --> 00:11:21.220
<i>What did she just say?</i>

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:23.810
<i>It wasn't "Anna".</i>

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.100
<i>It sounded like, "Maa-kun".</i>

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:27.050
<i>A man?!</i>

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:30.110
<i>Who the hell is Maa-kun?!</i>
